---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import caseImageVmi01 from '../../assets/case-image-vmi-01.png';
import caseImageVmi02 from '../../assets/case-image-vmi-02.png';
import caseImageVmi03 from '../../assets/case-image-vmi-03.png';
import caseImageVmi04 from '../../assets/case-image-vmi-04.png';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Redesigning Income Tax Declaration for an Entire Country"
  summary="Leading UX design for a nationwide income declaration wizard for the Lithuanian State Tax Inspectorate (VMI), increasing annual declarations by 300k to 1.6M users."
  role="Senior UX Designer"
  timeline="2017 - 2018"
  platform="Web"
>
  <!-- OVERVIEW -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12 anim-delay-2">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#787885] uppercase tracking-wider">Overview</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Executive summary</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          In 2019, the Lithuanian State Tax Inspectorate (VMI) launched a new income declaration
          wizard that fundamentally transformed how residents declare annual income. Replacing
          complex, table-based electronic forms with a question-and-answer flow, the solution
          enabled citizens to complete declarations faster, with fewer errors, and often without
          external help.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">Key results achieved after launch:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>
            Income declarations increased from <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]"
              >1.3 million (2018)</strong
            > to <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">approximately 1.6 million (2019)</strong>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">74% of taxpayers</strong> with fully known income data could
            submit a declaration with a <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">single click</strong>, often
            in just a few minutes
          </li>
          <li>
            The wizard became accessible to <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]"
              >over 2 million permanent Lithuanian residents</strong
            >
          </li>
          <li>Reduced error rates and lower demand for VMI customer support</li>
          <li>
            Awarded <em>Naujasis Knygnesys 2020</em> prizes: <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]"
              >Best Solution for Lithuania</strong
            > and <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">People’s Choice</strong>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          The project was delivered in collaboration with NRD Systems, with NFQ UX and design
          specialists responsible for user experience and interface design.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SITUATION -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12 anim-delay-3">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#787885] uppercase tracking-wider">Situation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Context & problem</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          For years, Lithuanian residents could declare income electronically, but the system was
          essentially a digital copy of paper tax forms introduced in 2004. While technically
          functional, it no longer matched modern user expectations or behaviors.
        </p>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED]">
            Key challenges in the existing system
          </h3>
          <ul
            class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885] mt-2"
          >
            <li>Long, technical, accounting-style forms that were difficult to understand</li>
            <li>High error rates and frequent user confusion</li>
            <li>
              Citizens often forgot to declare certain income types or were unaware they were
              required to
            </li>
            <li>Many users hired accountants solely due to system complexity</li>
            <li>
              Poor accessibility for mobile users, non-Lithuanian speakers, and people with special
              needs
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Although more than 1 million declarations were submitted annually, the process was
          time-consuming, intimidating, and discouraged timely compliance.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <Picture
            src={caseImageVmi01}
            alt="VMI case study - Situation"
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            fallbackFormat="png"
            widths={[472, 944]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 944px, 100vw"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            pictureAttributes={{ class: 'block' }}
            class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-lg"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ACTION -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12 anim-delay-4">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#787885] uppercase tracking-wider">Task</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Goals & objectives</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          The primary task was to design a system that would allow an average Lithuanian resident to
          declare income as simply and independently as possible.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">The project objectives were:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>Simplify income declaration without oversimplifying tax logic</li>
          <li>Reduce errors and uncertainty during the declaration process</li>
          <li>Enable citizens to complete declarations quickly and confidently</li>
          <li>Ensure accessibility across devices, languages, and user abilities</li>
          <li>Prepare the system for future changes in tax legislation</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          The solution needed to operate within Lithuania’s complex and evolving tax framework,
          including different income classes (A and B) and strict security and privacy requirements.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <Picture
            src={caseImageVmi02}
            alt="VMI case study - Task"
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            fallbackFormat="png"
            widths={[472, 944]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 944px, 100vw"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            pictureAttributes={{ class: 'block' }}
            class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-lg"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12 anim-delay-5">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#787885] uppercase tracking-wider">Action</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Process & solution</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          A human-centered design approach was applied throughout the project, following ISO
          9241:210 principles and involving continuous collaboration between designers, developers,
          VMI specialists, and users.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">Key actions taken:</p>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED]">User research and analysis</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>Conducted two large-scale surveys</li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">416 taxpayers</strong></li>
          <li><strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">161 VMI customer support specialists</strong></li>
          <li>
            Reviewed historical research data from nearly <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]"
              >10,000</strong
            > system users
          </li>
          <li>Performed 12 moderated usability observations using real declarations</li>
          <li>
            Identified seven key user groups, including employees, freelancers, students, farmers,
            expatriates, and tax professionals
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Key insights</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>Plain, human language instead of legal or accounting terminology</li>
          <li>Step-by-step guidance toward a clear goal</li>
          <li>Minimal manual data entry</li>
          <li>Immediate visibility of payable or refundable amounts</li>
          <li>Ability to pay taxes directly from the declaration</li>
          <li>
            Mobile access, multilingual support, accessibility features, and built-in error
            prevention
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Design and iteration</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>Replaced static forms with a guided question-and-answer flow</li>
          <li>Automatically pre-filled income and expense data already known to VMI</li>
          <li>Designed the wizard to adapt dynamically based on user answers</li>
          <li>
            Developed and tested over <strong class="text-[#EDEDED]">40</strong> prototype iterations,
            from low-to-high-fidelity
          </li>
          <li>Conducted usability testing with 12 participants representing core user groups</li>
          <li>Created a scalable design system and full UI specifications</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#EDEDED] mt-4">Content and collaboration</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>UX designers co-created copy with VMI to ensure clarity and plain language</li>
          <li>Balanced user needs with strict security and privacy requirements</li>
          <li>
            Maintained close alignment with VMI stakeholders who supported UX-driven decision-making
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <Picture
            src={caseImageVmi03}
            alt="VMI case study - Action"
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            fallbackFormat="png"
            widths={[472, 944]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 944px, 100vw"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            pictureAttributes={{ class: 'block' }}
            class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-lg"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RESULT -->
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12 anim-delay-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#787885] uppercase tracking-wider">Result</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Outcome & impact</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          The income declaration wizard replaced one of the most complex public digital services in
          Lithuania with a clear, accessible, and user-friendly experience.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">Measured and observed outcomes:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA]">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span
              >Declaration completion time reduced from hours to minutes in standard cases</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span
              >Errors and incomplete submissions decreased significantly</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span
              >Citizens gained confidence to declare income independently</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span
              >Reduced customer support workload for VMI staff</span
            >
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span
              >Encouraged broader participation in income declaration</span
            >
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">Broader impact:</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-disc pl-5 marker:text-[#787885]">
          <li>More efficient tax collection</li>
          <li>Increased transparency and trust between citizens and the state</li>
          <li>Improved accessibility and inclusion</li>
          <li>Positive long-term impact on Lithuania’s economic competitiveness</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          The project demonstrated how user-centered design can transform a nationwide, legally
          complex public service without compromising accuracy, security, or trust.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <Picture
            src={caseImageVmi04}
            alt="VMI case study - Result"
            formats={['avif', 'webp']}
            fallbackFormat="png"
            widths={[472, 944]}
            sizes="(min-width: 768px) 944px, 100vw"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            pictureAttributes={{ class: 'block' }}
            class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-white/5 shadow-lg"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>
